1
00:01:08,450 --> 00:01:12,980
[Faces Reborn]

2
00:01:13,060 --> 00:01:16,000
[Episode 23]

3
00:01:18,120 --> 00:01:19,750
Lin Di'er, stop right there!

4
00:01:21,710 --> 00:01:22,510
Lin Di'er.

5
00:01:22,710 --> 00:01:24,310
Why won't you leave me alone?

6
00:01:24,760 --> 00:01:25,690
Leave you alone?

7
00:01:26,150 --> 00:01:27,600
Everything you have is mine.

8
00:01:27,600 --> 00:01:28,760
If I want you dead,

9
00:01:28,780 --> 00:01:30,090
you won't live!

10
00:01:30,480 --> 00:01:31,070
Let go.

11
00:01:32,000 --> 00:01:32,860
Let me go!

12
00:01:33,070 --> 00:01:33,880
Let go!

13
00:02:42,079 --> 00:02:42,870
Xu Jing!

14
00:02:48,610 --> 00:02:50,010
I'll kill you!

15
00:02:50,120 --> 00:02:50,680
Are you okay?

16
00:02:50,680 --> 00:02:51,160
Bitch!

17
00:02:51,190 --> 00:02:52,140
Are you okay?

18
00:02:52,160 --> 00:02:53,560
Did he do anything to you?

19
00:02:54,150 --> 00:02:55,480
-Let go of me!
-I'm fine.

20
00:03:19,800 --> 00:03:20,500
Zhao Xiao.

21
00:03:20,750 --> 00:03:22,150
You are suspected of intentional homicide

22
00:03:22,150 --> 00:03:24,079
and illegal business operations.

23
00:03:24,079 --> 00:03:26,630
The public security authority summons you
in accordance with the law.

24
00:03:26,630 --> 00:03:27,829
This is your summons.

25
00:03:31,740 --> 00:03:38,340
[Police]

26
00:03:43,040 --> 00:03:44,750
Liar! Liar! Liar!

27
00:03:44,770 --> 00:03:46,260
Liar! Liar! Liar!

28
00:03:46,290 --> 00:03:46,670
Liar!

29
00:03:46,690 --> 00:03:47,100
Disgusting man!

30
00:03:47,100 --> 00:03:47,620
Scum!

31
00:03:47,640 --> 00:03:48,030
Liar!

32
00:03:48,050 --> 00:03:48,710
You liar!

33
00:03:48,730 --> 00:03:49,500
Liar!

34
00:03:51,110 --> 00:03:52,490
You brought this on yourself!

35
00:03:52,490 --> 00:03:53,740
That's too much!

36
00:03:57,820 --> 00:03:59,920
Put on some beautiful makeup.

37
00:04:01,240 --> 00:04:03,360
Mom, I'm a boy.

38
00:04:03,360 --> 00:04:04,890
Why do I have to wear makeup?

39
00:04:05,030 --> 00:04:06,910
Because only when you are beautiful

40
00:04:06,910 --> 00:04:08,790
will more people like you.

41
00:04:13,480 --> 00:04:14,680
That's right.

42
00:04:43,159 --> 00:04:43,950
Mom.

43
00:04:44,830 --> 00:04:46,480
From now on, I will never let anyone

44
00:04:46,480 --> 00:04:48,120
see this birthmark of mine.

45
00:04:48,560 --> 00:04:52,000
I want a perfectly flawless face.

46
00:05:09,190 --> 00:05:10,720
You brought your ID, right?

47
00:05:10,920 --> 00:05:12,910
Keep your valuables safe.

48
00:05:13,270 --> 00:05:14,540
Don't worry about me.

49
00:05:14,680 --> 00:05:16,210
Take good care of yourself.

50
00:05:23,800 --> 00:05:24,710
Fang Qi

51
00:05:24,730 --> 00:05:26,360
keeps asking about you.

52
00:05:26,920 --> 00:05:29,240
Aren't you going to see him one last time?

53
00:05:34,360 --> 00:05:35,690
Let the past be the past.

54
00:05:38,270 --> 00:05:39,530
After this parting,

55
00:05:39,600 --> 00:05:41,200
we will go our separate ways,

56
00:05:41,680 --> 00:05:43,620
not knowing when we'll meet again.

57
00:05:43,750 --> 00:05:44,270
Jia'an.

58
00:05:45,390 --> 00:05:47,320
Then come with me to one more place.

59
00:06:08,950 --> 00:06:10,000
A'lan.

60
00:06:10,120 --> 00:06:11,450
Give me a hand.

61
00:06:11,720 --> 00:06:12,980
-Mom.
-It's too heavy.

62
00:06:15,720 --> 00:06:17,320
Sit here and rest for a while.

63
00:06:18,410 --> 00:06:19,870
Look what I bought for you.

64
00:06:21,750 --> 00:06:22,390
Mom.

65
00:06:23,040 --> 00:06:24,000
I'm all grown up.

66
00:06:24,000 --> 00:06:26,200
Why did you still buy me this bunny doll?

67
00:06:26,680 --> 00:06:29,680
I saw a lady selling these
on my way grocery‑shopping.

68
00:06:30,310 --> 00:06:31,640
She looked like
she was having a hard time,

69
00:06:31,640 --> 00:06:32,520
so I bought one.

70
00:06:33,430 --> 00:06:36,350
When you were little,
you loved these little things.

71
00:06:36,350 --> 00:06:38,280
You would never want to leave them.

72
00:06:38,820 --> 00:06:40,030
It's a pity

73
00:06:40,430 --> 00:06:43,090
that our family couldn't afford them
back then.

74
00:06:47,280 --> 00:06:47,990
Mom.

75
00:06:51,680 --> 00:06:53,670
You are actually a really good mom.

76
00:06:54,720 --> 00:06:55,780
Of course I am.

77
00:06:56,000 --> 00:06:56,950
Silly girl.

78
00:07:02,800 --> 00:07:04,820
Qiao has loved this doll
since she was little.

79
00:07:04,820 --> 00:07:06,160
She carried it everywhere.

80
00:07:06,160 --> 00:07:08,780
Once, Lin Di'er saw it was torn,

81
00:07:08,870 --> 00:07:11,360
she wanted to throw it away
and buy her a new one.

82
00:07:11,360 --> 00:07:13,780
Qiao sneaked out of bed in the middle
of the night to find the nanny

83
00:07:13,780 --> 00:07:15,440
and asked her to sew it back up.

84
00:07:20,160 --> 00:07:21,000
Go ahead.

85
00:07:21,260 --> 00:07:23,570
Fortunately, you only missed three years.

86
00:07:23,570 --> 00:07:24,440
In the future,

87
00:07:24,800 --> 00:07:26,530
you still have a long, long time

88
00:07:26,830 --> 00:07:28,060
to watch her grow up.

89
00:07:50,720 --> 00:07:51,480
Qiao.

90
00:07:53,920 --> 00:07:54,920
Look what this is.

91
00:07:55,680 --> 00:07:56,750
They look the same.

92
00:07:56,750 --> 00:07:58,280
Are they sisters?

93
00:07:58,310 --> 00:07:59,409
Maybe.

94
00:08:01,430 --> 00:08:03,160
How about I give this one to you?

95
00:08:03,520 --> 00:08:04,190
Look.

96
00:08:07,950 --> 00:08:08,750
Do you like it?

97
00:08:11,600 --> 00:08:13,600
What's wrong? You don't want it?

98
00:08:14,160 --> 00:08:14,870
Yours is very new,

99
00:08:14,870 --> 00:08:17,820
but mine is my favorite little bunny.

100
00:08:19,480 --> 00:08:20,270
Well,

101
00:08:21,730 --> 00:08:23,730
isn't it nicer to have one more bunny

102
00:08:23,750 --> 00:08:24,870
to keep you company?

103
00:08:24,870 --> 00:08:26,370
You just said

104
00:08:26,720 --> 00:08:27,630
that the two of them look

105
00:08:27,630 --> 00:08:29,190
like sisters, right?

106
00:08:30,720 --> 00:08:31,480
Then take it.

107
00:08:42,789 --> 00:08:43,740
Qiao.

108
00:08:45,360 --> 00:08:46,130
Tell me,

109
00:08:47,480 --> 00:08:49,550
does your mom spend
very little time with you?

110
00:08:49,550 --> 00:08:50,550
No.

111
00:08:50,750 --> 00:08:52,390
She's too busy.

112
00:08:53,390 --> 00:08:56,910
But now I don't even have a mom.

113
00:08:59,390 --> 00:09:00,200
It's okay.

114
00:09:02,790 --> 00:09:03,670
Qiao.

115
00:09:08,750 --> 00:09:10,440
How about you come live with me

116
00:09:11,090 --> 00:09:12,150
from now on?

117
00:09:12,390 --> 00:09:14,600
But I don't even know you yet.

118
00:09:16,650 --> 00:09:17,810
Well, look,

119
00:09:18,900 --> 00:09:20,640
you didn't know the little bunny

120
00:09:20,640 --> 00:09:22,080
the moment you were born either,

121
00:09:22,080 --> 00:09:22,870
right?

122
00:09:23,670 --> 00:09:26,200
You'll have a long,
long time to get to know me.

123
00:09:26,240 --> 00:09:26,960
Okay?

124
00:09:27,820 --> 00:09:29,020
Let's live together.

125
00:09:30,120 --> 00:09:30,840
Okay?

126
00:09:34,600 --> 00:09:35,630
Can I have a hug?

127
00:09:47,910 --> 00:09:51,840
I'll love you just like
your little bunny does.

128
00:10:27,900 --> 00:10:28,660
I'm sorry

129
00:10:29,600 --> 00:10:30,960
for making you wait so long.

130
00:10:30,960 --> 00:10:31,720
Three years.

131
00:10:32,080 --> 00:10:32,790
It's okay.

132
00:10:34,360 --> 00:10:35,820
We finally made it.

133
00:10:36,360 --> 00:10:37,270
You know what?

134
00:10:38,480 --> 00:10:41,080
Xiaoxiao is starting kindergarten
next year.

135
00:10:41,860 --> 00:10:44,260
I looked at several kindergartens for her,

136
00:10:45,360 --> 00:10:47,560
but I wasn't satisfied with any of them.

137
00:10:48,080 --> 00:10:48,670
I know.

138
00:10:50,030 --> 00:10:51,630
You want to give her the best.

139
00:10:52,000 --> 00:10:53,110
Can I really do it?

140
00:10:53,870 --> 00:10:54,630
You can.

141
00:10:55,870 --> 00:10:57,200
You've already done it.

142
00:10:58,550 --> 00:11:00,960
You are about to start your own life.

143
00:11:02,270 --> 00:11:03,400
And I should move on.

144
00:11:05,600 --> 00:11:06,390
No.

145
00:11:08,360 --> 00:11:09,270
It's us.

146
00:11:10,150 --> 00:11:12,150
We're about to have a new life.

147
00:11:12,390 --> 00:11:15,240
My life has carried too much sorrow.

148
00:11:16,070 --> 00:11:18,000
Maybe you should learn to let it go.

149
00:11:18,910 --> 00:11:19,550
That way,

150
00:11:20,390 --> 00:11:22,390
you can move toward a better future.

151
00:11:23,080 --> 00:11:24,840
But if it weren't for this pain,

152
00:11:26,270 --> 00:11:27,800
I wouldn't be who I am today.

153
00:11:30,150 --> 00:11:31,910
We are both a part of each other.
